 "notes": [
  "Sowing windows start from each seed packet page (Magic Garden Seeds / Kokopelli) and are adjusted for the Pays de Gex: ~500 m altitude, last frost around mid-May (after the Ice Saints), first frost around mid-October.",
  "Early = 1st–15th of the month, Late = 16th to month end.",
  "Peppers, chillies and aubergines need a heated propagator (24–30 °C) and grow lights for the Jan–Mar sowings; tomatoes 20–28 °C. Other module sowings are fine in an unheated greenhouse.",
  "The pepper and loofah pages give no sowing months, and the Nantes carrot page gives almost none, so those windows follow standard guidance for this climate.",
  "Winter pea 'Sima' is sown mid-October to early November for a crop the following May–July.",
  "Companion clashes from the packets: onions vs beans/peas; purple carrot vs parsnip; kale vs onion/garlic/potato; beetroot vs chard/spinach/tomato; tomato vs peppers/potato/cucumber; squash vs potato/dill."
